":"unknown","text":"Where did the new dragon near Brandonsford come from?","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_new_4","kind":"unknown","text":"Is there really a dragon? Grimny says the lair cave was empty, unvisited and just one small room, and Dunk suspects Bral is faking a dragon to keep everyone away.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_16"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_77","beat_78"]},{"id":"fact_new_5","kind":"could_use","text":"The writing Dr. Uriah read on the party's map marks one location as \"Dragon's lair,\" so the map shows where the lair is.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_1"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_20"]},{"id":"fact_new_6","kind":"could_use","text":"The party holds Sir Brandon's sword, a magic sword especially effective against evil beings.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_4"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_3","beat_18"]},{"id":"fact_new_7","kind":"could_use","text":"Vivian says enough faun wine drunk by the dragon would knock it out so the sword could be dragged through its mouth as Sir Brandon did; Dunk already holds enough faun wine.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":